#. Global message key: aboutBody1
#: src/data/i18n.js:1
msgctxt "text:aboutBody1"
msgid ""
"Touhou University sits inside the Great Barrier, connecting the Human "
"Village, Youkai Mountain, Misty Lake, and the Bamboo Forest. It is a place "
"where people with different lifespans, abilities, and common sense build "
"methods they can share."
msgstr ""
"Touhou University sits inside the Great Barrier, connecting the Human "
"Village, Youkai Mountain, Misty Lake, and the Bamboo Forest. It is a place "
"where people with different lifespans, abilities, and common sense build "
"methods they can share."

#. Global message key: aboutBody2
#: src/data/i18n.js:1
msgctxt "text:aboutBody2"
msgid ""
"Incidents, legends, and everyday life are serious subjects of research here. "
"Every form of knowledge must answer who may use it, who bears the risk, and "
"how its findings will serve Gensokyo."
msgstr ""
"Incidents, legends, and everyday life are serious subjects of research here. "
"Every form of knowledge must answer who may use it, who bears the risk, and "
"how its findings will serve Gensokyo."

